%C - This application shows a basic example of decryption

Syntax:
    decrypt_app  <options>    

Options (to override autodetected defaults):

    f<filename>  GPIO Module [0:7]
    v            Enable verbosity
    
Example:
    # Decrypt a signed file, called signed_image, be verbos
    # with output
    decrypt_app -f signed_image -v
    
Notes:
    - A signed file, is required to run this application.
